' The simulated path is the one that exists in code today:
' evidence -> register -> public surface -> validator -> Docs CI.
@startuml
title Main path — closing one CWA finding

participant "Protocol/deployment\nevidence" as Evidence
participant "Community audit\nreport" as Report
participant "CWA register\n(JSON)" as Register
participant "Register view\n(Markdown)" as RegisterMd
participant "Public surfaces" as Surfaces
participant "Docs validators" as Validators
participant "Docs CI" as CI

Evidence -> Report : verified value at a pinned block/commit
Report -> Register : finding id + frozen severity
Evidence -> Surfaces : the value a surface is allowed to state
Register -> Surfaces : expectedDispositionTotals status markers
Register -> RegisterMd : renderMarkdown (build:cwa-register --write)

Surfaces -> Validators : text under assertion
Register -> Validators : disposition under assertion
Evidence -> Validators : source of truth under assertion

Validators -> Validators : check-cwa-remediation-register.cjs\ntest-cwa-docs-closure.cjs\ntest-security-reporting-config.cjs
Validators -> CI : npm run test:* exit status
CI -> CI : test-docs-workflow.cjs asserts the command set
CI --> Register : green == the finding is closed with evidence
@enduml
